  "final_message": "Wait for `npm test` to finish.\nWait for `git grep \"OrderPlaced\"` to finish.\nWait for `npm run arch` to finish.\nWait for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nWait for `npm test` to finish.\nWait for `npm run arch` to finish.\nWait for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nWait for `git diff` to finish.\nThe [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36) event has been updated to align field naming with the Payments and Customer APIs while adhering to **ARCH-4** (additive evolution and deprecation to prevent breaking deployed consumers `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `amountCents: number` and `createdAt: string` to the [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36) event interface.\n   - Retained `totalCents` and `placedAt` marked with `@deprecated` tags to preserve backward compatibility per ARCH-4.\n   - Updated the [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) factory function to populate both the new and deprecated fields.\n\n2. **Tests Updated**:\n   - **[`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/test/app.test.ts)**: Updated integration tests to verify both new and deprecated properties on published events.\n   - **[`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/test/adapters.test.ts)**: Verified Kafka serialized event payloads include both new and deprecated attributes.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: Passed (all 39 tests passing).\n- `npm run arch`: Passed (no dependency-cruiser violations).\n- `npm run typecheck`: Passed (clean type check).\n",
